// @8bitscript/vic20 — VIC-20 target support.
//
// The module entry point named by the "8bitscript".entry field in this
// package's package.json, loaded by the compiler's resolver for:
//
//     import { vic } from "@8bitscript/vic20";
//
// INTENDED SURFACE, NOT AN IMPLEMENTATION, for the same reason as
// @8bitscript/core: the declaration syntax is not designed yet.
//
//   vic
//       Direct access to the VIC chip's registers and the VIC-20's memory map.
//
// This package is where "portable APIs, without losing the target" is paid for.
// @8bitscript/core stays identical everywhere; the machine underneath is
// reached through here, and a project that imports this package has declared
// itself VIC-20 specific.
